  "details": "My avatars has a bug that the positions of the hand seen by another person and the position of the hand seen by me shifts when they are crouching.\nThese avatars are created by the following procedure.\n1. Output the VRM format avatar with \"VRoid Studio 0.9.5 Win\".\n2. Create a project with \"Unity 2018.4.20f1\".\n3. Import \"VRCSDK2-2020.06.16.20.54_Public.unitypackage\".\n4. Import \"VRM Converter for VRChat-21.0.0 + UniVRM-0.55.0.unitypackage\".\n5. Import the VRM format avatar.\n6. Convert the avatar with \"VRM Converter for VRChat 21.0.0\".\n7. Adjust \"View Position\" and upload.\nThis is the sample avator.\nhttps://www.vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_258d6a91-4334-40bb-85a2-e0522a0d9535",
